  "title": "Dual-Mode Low-Rank Learner with Bridge-Prototype Ensemble for Vision-Language Class-Incremental Learning",
  "summary": "CLIP has been widely adopted for class-incremental learning (CIL), but existing learners face challenges with knowledge overwriting and a modality gap. The introduction of DuLBE addresses these issues by using dual-mode low-rank learning with a bridge-prototype ensemble classifier, enabling exemplar-free CIL while preserving visual and reasoning capabilities.",
